# Stub for the stock /FWUpgradeInit.rc.
#
# The stock 8.1 boot ramdisk ships this file at the filesystem root and
# init.mt6765.rc imports it by absolute path:
#
#     import /FWUpgradeInit.rc
#
# It holds the ColorOS firmware-upgrade (OTA recovery) init actions. The
# CPH1909 A.46 dump does not contain it, and this tree does not ship any
# of the upgrade binaries it would reference, so the import would fail
# with "cannot open /FWUpgradeInit.rc" on every boot.
#
# This file is installed into the root of the system image (which is the
# root filesystem on this non-system-as-root, ramdisk-booting device) by
# device.mk, so init can read it. Keep it empty (comments only): init
# accepts an empty rc file.